WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.920
It's our business together

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.560
to take care of Ukrainian people
and they really need those buses.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:10.280
So it's really important
and it's just a sincere feel of help

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.800
that we are all going to do
for Ukrainian people.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.440
And it's really good
that the company will give the buses

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.680
and they are all in good shape
and they are going

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.680
directly from work for the donation.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.600
So they are in really
good shape for the cause.

